usage:
Optional Extension configuration:
{"time":"[time:%H:%M;Europe/Brussels]","burn_in_shift_minutes":60,"speed":1.0,"block_color":"#55D7E8","clock_color":"#F3D24B"}

The time binding supplies the four hour-and-minute digits; colon separators are optional. The default is [time:%H%M]. speed controls all falling and playfield animation from 0.25 (slow) to 4.0 (fast); the default is 1.0. block_color and clock_color accept optional six-digit RGB colors with an optional leading #; lighter and darker sprite variants are generated from each color. The clock sits above a live block-drop playfield. Every configured interval, it shifts to a nearby vertical grid position to vary static pixels. Set burn_in_shift_minutes to 0 to disable repositioning.
